<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on July 22.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on July 22.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at</p>
<p>Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget</p>
<p>statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 22		July 21</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.918		  6.027</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  23.598		 22.050</p>
<p>Cash balance		  28.516		 28.077</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,280.663	     5,278.227</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $159 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
